@startuml
!theme plain
title Scrum Process - ZAI E-commerce Development

!define PHASE rectangle
!define ARTIFACT note
!define ROLE actor

ROLE ProductOwner as "Product Owner"
ROLE ScrumMaster as "Scrum Master" 
ROLE DevTeam as "Development Team"

package "Sprint Cycle (2-4 weeks)" {
    PHASE SprintPlanning as "Sprint Planning"
    PHASE DailyScrum as "Daily Scrum"
    PHASE SprintReview as "Sprint Review"
    PHASE SprintRetro as "Sprint Retrospective"
    
    package "Development Activities" {
        PHASE Development as "Development Work"
        PHASE Testing as "Testing & QA"
        PHASE Integration as "Dolibarr Integration"
        PHASE Documentation as "Documentation"
    }
}

package "Artifacts" {
    ARTIFACT ProductBacklog as "Product Backlog\n• User Stories\n• Acceptance Criteria\n• Priority Ranking"
    ARTIFACT SprintBacklog as "Sprint Backlog\n• Selected User Stories\n• Tasks Breakdown\n• Effort Estimation"
    ARTIFACT Increment as "Product Increment\n• Working Software\n• Tested Features\n• Deployable Code"
}

package "ZAI Project Sprints" {
    PHASE Sprint1 as "Sprint 1\nAuthentication\n& User Management"
    PHASE Sprint2 as "Sprint 2\nProduct Catalog\n& Shopping Cart"
    PHASE Sprint3 as "Sprint 3\nOrders & Customer\nSupport System"
}

' Relationships
ProductOwner --> ProductBacklog : maintains
ProductOwner --> SprintPlanning : participates
ProductOwner --> SprintReview : accepts/rejects

ScrumMaster --> SprintPlanning : facilitates
ScrumMaster --> DailyScrum : facilitates
ScrumMaster --> SprintReview : facilitates
ScrumMaster --> SprintRetro : facilitates

DevTeam --> SprintPlanning : estimates & commits
DevTeam --> DailyScrum : reports progress
DevTeam --> Development : implements
DevTeam --> Testing : validates
DevTeam --> Integration : integrates with Dolibarr
DevTeam --> Documentation : documents

ProductBacklog --> SprintPlanning : input
SprintPlanning --> SprintBacklog : creates
Development --> Increment : produces
Testing --> Increment : validates
Integration --> Increment : enhances

SprintBacklog --> Development : guides
Increment --> SprintReview : demonstrates
SprintReview --> ProductBacklog : feedback
SprintRetro --> SprintPlanning : improvements

' Sprint Flow
Sprint1 --> Sprint2 : iteration
Sprint2 --> Sprint3 : iteration

note bottom of Sprint1 : **Deliverables:**\n• User Registration/Login\n• Session Management\n• Dolibarr User Sync\n• Security Implementation

note bottom of Sprint2 : **Deliverables:**\n• Product Display\n• Category Management\n• Shopping Cart\n• Search Functionality

note bottom of Sprint3 : **Deliverables:**\n• Order Processing\n• Payment Integration\n• Support Tickets\n• Email Notifications

@enduml